# 行尾规范（本机 core.autocrlf=true，必须显式声明否则提交后被归一化）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary

# 二进制（严禁行尾转换：gradle wrapper jar / 原生库 / 安装包 / 签名文件）
*.jar binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
